---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us — SWP Intelligence Engine" description="About the SWP Intelligence Engine, built to help investors simulate retirement cash flows with 10,000 Monte Carlo iterations.">
	<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24 text-navy-700 dark:text-navy-300 space-y-6">
		<div class="border-b border-navy-200 dark:border-white/10 pb-6 mb-8">
			<h1 class="text-hero sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy-900 dark:text-navy-100">
				About SWP Intelligence Engine
			</h1>
			<p class="text-base text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
				Engineering mathematical clarity for retirement financial planning.
			</p>
		</div>

		<section class="space-y-4 reveal">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-navy-100">Our Mission</h2>
			<p class="leading-relaxed">
				Traditional retirement calculators make dangerous static assumptions—assuming your portfolio grows at a flat, constant percentage every year. Real markets swing, and the order the swings arrive in matters as much as the average: a bad decade at the start of a retirement does far more damage than the same decade at the end, because the early losses come out of a pot you are also drawing an income from. Inflation and tax do the rest.
			</p>
			<p class="leading-relaxed">
				<strong>SWP Intelligence Engine</strong> was created to give retirees, financial planners, and long-term investors an institutional-grade Monte Carlo stress-testing engine that runs entirely client-side inside the browser.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="space-y-4 reveal">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-navy-100">Key Technology Features</h2>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
				<li><strong>10,000 Monte Carlo Stress Tests:</strong> Digital dice rolls simulating randomized market lifetimes.</li>
				<li><strong>100% Client-Side Privacy:</strong> Web Worker background calculations mean your private numbers never leave your browser.</li>
				<li><strong>Tax-Aware Calculations:</strong> Accounts for Indian LTCG tax exemptions and tax friction over decades.</li>
				<li><strong>Inflation Step-Up Engine:</strong> Dynamically scales monthly paychecks every year to protect purchasing power.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="space-y-4 reveal">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-navy-100">Get in Touch</h2>
			<p class="leading-relaxed">
				We are constantly refining our financial models and UI. If you have feature requests or feedback, please visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 underline font-medium">Contact Page</a> or reach out at <code class="bg-navy-100 dark:bg-navy-900 px-2 py-1 rounded text-navy-800 dark:text-navy-200">support@swpplanner.com</code>.
			</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
